  "access": {
    "level": "restricted",
    "note": "Gated road at NF-750 with about 1.7 miles of road walking to the summit; the nearby OHV trail system closes June 1 to October 1. A 2023 trip report says visitors are not invited up to the cab; its writers had read this was because of heavy traffic from people and ATVs. That is one visitor's account, not an official access rule."
  },
